{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38568","headline":"得京中亲友书讶久无音耗以诗代谢 · 吴融","name":"得京中亲友书讶久无音耗以诗代谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"退闲何事不忘机，况限溪云静掩扉。\n马颊浪高鱼去少，鸡鸣关险雁来稀。\n无才敢更期连茹，有意兼思学采薇。\n珍重故人知我者，九霄休复寄音徽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}